# OS package workflow

- **Never edit** `Urban Nail Bar (Windows 11)/` by hand. It is finished.
- Windows 11 may **only** receive automated sync (data + UI) from macOS.
- **Active edit package:** `Urban Nail Bar (macOS High Sierra)/` (macOS Sierra work happens here).
- Keep `Urban Nail Bar (macOS Big Sur)/` matching via `_sync/MIRROR-ALL-THREE.js`.
- UI mirror: **High Sierra → Big Sur + Windows 11** (Windows is never a UI source).
- Live data hub: `_shared-salon-data/` for all three OS packages.
- Do not reinvent features inside the Windows 11 folder.
